has always one real", "bbox": {"x": 134.40397331220723, "y": 1075.4999999916552, "width": 713.8344370860927, "height": 29.875000000000053}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "positive root.", "bbox": {"x": 103.87771106996865, "y": 1105.6985879149806, "width": 165.06382036524897, "height": 30.771459978818797}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "When I is known, the values of m and n are", "bbox": {"x": 265.82119188955386, "y": 1108.3624999906053, "width": 585.4039735099337, "height": 29.874999999999893}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "determined from equation (3). The solutions of the two equations", "bbox": {"x": 103.70976623974464, "y": 1136.3931284954704, "width": 744.8768912814311, "height": 63.29604935646057}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2十1+m=0", "bbox": {"x": 385.29139058167027, "y": 1189.0249999797456, "width": 179.20529801324506, "height": 23.900000000000073}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "and", "bbox": {"x": 104.53642561371008, "y": 1230.8500003139422, "width": 44.801321654919754, "height": 23.89999857544899}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2ー1+n=0", "bbox": {"x": 394.25165548809787, "y": 1230.8499999778705, "width": 170.2450331125828, "height": 23.900000000000073}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "produce the required roots.", "bbox": {"x": 104.14355149618314, "y": 1270.9075491476265, "width": 323.1271147570073, "height": 31.89469850659379}}], "ms": 260.24325}